2026-07-27T11:06:40.1082686Z i /tmp/Rtmpg0Ylir/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:06:40.1083222Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:06:40.1083827Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:06:40.1084353Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:06:40.1085211Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:06:40.1086447Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:06:40.1087777Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
